Changes made in this repository
-------------------------------

Required by AGPL-3.0 section 5(a). See the git history for exact diffs.

* Added `calc-api/` — a thin, stateless HTTP service exposing the engine's public
  functions as a JSON API, with a Dockerfile and deployment configuration.
  AGPL-3.0, like the engine.

* `core/types.py`, `chart/sade_sati.py`: `SadeSatiResult` now reports Sade Sati
  proper, Small Panoti and Ashtama Shani as three separate flags
  (`is_sade_sati`, `is_small_panoti`, `is_ashtama_shani`) alongside the existing
  `is_active` umbrella. Previously all three were collapsed into `is_active`,
  which disagreed with reference sources that report them separately.

* `core/types.py`, `dosha/calculator.py`: `DoshaResult` gained `convention` and
  `basis`, so doshas whose definitions are genuinely disputed state which reading
  they applied and show the computed evidence. Kaal Sarpa and Shani Dosha
  populate both. No verdict logic was changed.

* `benchmarks/accuracy.py`: added a pinned `REFERENCE_DATE` and removed every
  clock read from the comparison path, so results are reproducible. Corrected two
  comparisons that compared unlike things — a natal indicator against a current
  transit, and a strict reading against an umbrella one.

* `calc-api/`: KP planet and sign fields are rendered as symbolic names rather
  than raw integers. The engine types those fields as plain `int`, so they carried
  no enum type and would otherwise reach callers as Swiss Ephemeris ids and
  1-based sign indices.

Engine fixes are offered upstream as pull requests.


